    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπολ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			Arc.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰνπολά</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			5(2).3.27
		</span></i> (pl., Tegea, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>merchandise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				930
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλκάδας γεμούσας . . ἐμπολῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.1.23
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλεον ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i><i>Hyps Fr.</i><i><span class="en">
				41(64).87
			</span></i> (lyr.): pl., <i>wares,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
			</span></i>l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>traffic, purchase</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1111
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.2.39
			</span></i>: pl., <i>ventures</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				555.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>gain made by traffic, profit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθέμεν τῷ᾽ Ἀσκλαπιῷ τὰς ἐ. τῶν
					ἰχθύων Ἀρχ. Ἐφ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1918.168
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Palaeph.
				45
			</span></i>; esp. <i>harlot's hire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.78
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				79.13
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
